sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant W as Web UI
    participant A as FastAPI routes
    participant O as OCR (ml/ocr)
    participant F as Features (ml/features)
    participant P as Python model
    participant C as Card renderer
    participant T as Teachable Machine
    participant E as Decision engine
    participant D as Database

    U->>W: Upload receipt
    W->>A: POST document
    A->>A: check type, size, SHA-256 hash
    A->>O: extract_fields(file)
    O-->>A: invoice no., date, serial, amount
    A->>D: save document + extracted fields
    A-->>W: extracted fields to verify
    U->>W: correct fields, submit claim
    W->>A: POST claim
    A->>D: load product, documents, repairs
    A->>F: build_features(claim, product, documents, repairs)
    F-->>A: ClaimFeatures
    A->>P: predict(features)
    P-->>A: class + 3 probabilities, model v1
    A->>C: render_card(features)
    C-->>A: card image
    A->>T: predict_card(image)
    T-->>A: class + 3 probabilities, model v1
    A->>E: decide(features, python, teachable)
    E-->>A: decision, consistency, rules, explanation
    A->>D: save predictions, rule results, status, audit entry
    A-->>W: result page
    W-->>U: decision and explanation
